cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FlyMind: Predicting Directed Neuron Connectivity from Biological and Morphological Features in the Drosophila Connectome"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "FlyMind Research Group"
date-released: "2026-09-20"
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/akkushon-kamen/flymind"
license: "See repository for license information"
description: |
  FlyMind learns how neuron-level biological and morphological properties
  relate to directed connectivity in the fruit-fly brain, validates those
  relationships on previously unseen neurons, and ranks model-suggested
  candidate connections for further investigation.
keywords:
  - connectomics
  - drosophila
  - flywire
  - link-prediction
  - random-forest
  - neuroscience
  - machine-learning
